# Unity — https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Unity.gitignore
#
# Library/ = 에디터·임포트 캐시 전부 (푸시 금지)
#   - ShaderCache, Bee/Artifacts, PackageCache(URP 등 패키지 셰이더 포함),
#     AI.CoreGraph 등 “셰이더/패키지 덩어리”로 보이는 것도 여기서 나온다.
# Assets/ 아래 *.shader / Shader Graph는 프로젝트 자산이므로 커밋하는 게 맞다.

/[Ll]ibrary/

# macOS
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/

# Uncomment if you do not use the asset store tools inside Assets
# /[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*

/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*

.vs/
.gradle/

ExportedObj/
.consulo/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta

sysinfo.txt

*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app

crashlytics-build.properties

/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*

/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*
